{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/1738745979885.png?t=1740667975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a third-person action roguelite game. Players will play one of several protagonists to challenge powerful enemies in the Animal Realm and solve the source of the mutation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include 4 protagonists with different fighting styles to unlock, more than 12 boss battles based on various Touhou characters, and nearly 100 kinds of enhanced abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u6894\u4e46\u67cc-\u5d43\u696b_\u6894\u67cc.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5ce0\u677a\u5aff-\u50fc\u5114\u511e\u50ea\u4e55\u5116\u4e12\u50d7\u50c7\u4e55\u5117\u50e2\u50e9.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5ea1\u6056\u5c9e-\u67d6\u5849_\u677a\u68df\u5d50.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5871\u682d\u5f7a-\u6457\u5c28_\u6780\u5ce0.png?t=1740667975\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25cfEXCITING BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In terms of combat, the operation is simplified, while the operation threshold is minimized as much as possible, while retaining the tension and excitement brought by action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Clear all obstacles with flawless skill!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u683c\u6321.gif?t=1740667975\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25cfRICH TALENT ENHANCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process, each protagonist has a unique enhancement ability to choose from, and some powerful enhancement abilities will directly change the character's fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Face all challenges with the strongest attitude!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/20250205172821.gif?t=1740667975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5ea1\u6056\u5c9e-\u6537\u6949_\u6948\u67cc.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5871\u682d\u5f7a-\u6945\u612c\u4e12\u686a\u64a5\u58fa\u583e\u4e12\u50c0\u50eb\u50f6.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5ce0\u677a\u5aff-\u5ce0_\u65e4\u6945.png?t=1740667975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/\u5d41\u5eab\u63f1-\u5a6c\u6044_\u50d2\u50cc\u510a.png?t=1740667975\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25cfHIGHLY ANTICIPATED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Primate Spirit Garden is restored, it will attract visitors of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will meet visitors of different characteristics in the game and get their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Let\u2019s liven up the Primate Spirit Garden!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/20250205173233.gif?t=1740667975\" /></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265060?t=1740667975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap